"A private magical contract is sealed by tattoos, which serve as its proof."
"Private contracts lack full System oversight and can omit the human protections."
"The Interdimensional Warriors Contract cannot be overwritten and takes precedence for summons."
"Acts done to satisfy a magical contract with a wizard cannot be punished."
"A tattoo's shapes mean only what both parties assign them, though some are traditional."
"Simple shapes work better; complex contracts need a professional to align both minds."
"Professionals align the parties while they get high together for a few hours."
"The stronger party empowers the contract and its understanding crushes the weaker's."
"If the parties' understandings are too misaligned, the contract will not form."
"Unlinked parts of a contract tattoo take months to remove."
"Artonan officials and teachers carry large networks of dark blue contract tattoos."
"Classes on safe contracting are standard at Anesidoran high schools."
"Wizard-to-wizard contracts are nearly the oldest form of magic, and are used for blackmail."
"A renewable contract can be renewed by touching the tattoo and agreeing aloud; it then warms."
"A secrecy clause can leave a party physically unable to voice forbidden questions."
"Contract tattoos are painted with magic ink and brushes."
"Secrets sealed by a contract tattoo cannot be taken even under torture."
"Everyone who helps with demon suppression gets a secrecy tattoo."
"The Velra family brand tattoo is a contract, but cannot override Contract duties."
"Artonan Contract Artists hold contracts sacred: anyone may make one for whatever they want."
"A contract with many details needs multiple tattoos and multiple sessions."
"Seriously thinking of breaking one brings a felt denial of the possibility."
"Finished portions of a contract tattoo can be removed; a knight can erase them in seconds."
"A secrecy contract can also forbid deliberately making someone suspicious of the secret."
